<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:1.4em; font-size:16px;"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(255, 255, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text">View upcoming events and our live calendar.</span></span></p></div><div id="comp-ksflaupd" class="comp-ksflaupd wixui-image-button" aria-describedby="a501e148-3a99-4faf-84cd-e252959d0568"><a data-testid="link" href="https://www.nelsoncathedral.nz/copy-of-your-dean" target="_self" class="ScPWgD sYnD5h" aria-label="" tabindex="0"><div class="ugyP6o" data-testid="linkImageContainer"><div class="RuqxDs"><img sizes="47px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/9c608a_36076ec0f2214a39a25dc1ac6aaf9527~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_47,h_28,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/9c608a_36076ec0f2214a39a25dc1ac6aaf9527~mv2.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/9c608a_36076ec0f2214a39a25dc1ac6aaf9527~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_94,h_56,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/9c608a_36076ec0f2214a39a25dc1ac6aaf9527~mv2.png 2x" id="img_comp-ksflaupd_0" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/9c608a_36076ec0f2214a39a25dc1ac6aaf9527~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_47,h_28,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/9c608a_36076ec0f2214a39a25dc1ac6aaf9527~mv2.png" alt="" role="none" style="object-fit:contain;object-position:unset" class="W1Wg1l sFiSiq" width="47" height="48"/></div><div class="RuqxDs"><img sizes="47px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/9c608a_2871947e950644c0be2cf5b9a583cc3a~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_47,h_28,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/9c608a_2871947e950644c0be2cf5b9a583cc3a~mv2.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/9c608a_2871947e950644c0be2cf5b9a583cc3a~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_94,h_56,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/9c608a_2871947e950644c0be2cf5b9a583cc3a~mv2.png 2x" id="img_comp-ksflaupd_1" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/9c608a_2871947e950644c0be2cf5b9a583cc3a~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_47,h_28,al_c,q_